  "newFunctions": [
    "real local workerd fences a superseded avatar, removes its transfer metadata and preserves the current picture",
    "withdrawing a staged photo retires its exact version and later removes both asset fields and local secrets",
    "retiring a superseded picture preserves the new approved publication and its asset commitments",
    "failed or idempotent selection changes cannot retire a current photo or extend an existing retirement deadline",
    "bounded legacy backfill discovers historical versions after clear and keeps the latest selection untouched",
    "a late original CREATE cannot resurrect a photo withdrawn while its provider response was held",
    "a forged retirement for the current picture fails before photo IO instead of deleting its assets",
    "unknown retirement writes stay retryable and an actual account deletion has priority over avatar retention",
    "retired avatar metadata and leases survive a fresh registry instance without reopening mutation access",
    "retirement is atomic with a selection transaction and survives an unknown durability response",
    "file-backed reopen preserves retirement time and provider fencing without a fresh upload",
    "key-free local maintenance expires encrypted upload receipts while retaining consumed transfers and source scope",
    "an incomplete or corrupt current selection cannot authorize retirement of historical assets",
    "local cleanup accepts the older transfer schema with no receipt column without needing provider keys",
    "a rolled-back clock cannot replace a later clear intent or move its retirement deadline backwards"
  ],
